---
title Sequência — POST /api/v1/leads (deduplicação concorrente + distribuição)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Cliente (CRM)
  participant API as API REST
  participant R as Redis
  participant L as LeadService
  participant D as DistributionService
  participant DB as MySQL

  C->>API: POST /api/v1/leads (X-API-Key, JSON)
  API->>R: INCR/EXPIRE rate limit (fail-open se Redis cair)
  API->>API: apiKeyAuth, validate (Zod strict)
  API->>L: create(input, channel=api, requestId)
  L->>L: normalize(phone) → E.164
  L->>DB: BEGIN (READ COMMITTED)
  L->>DB: INSERT leads (...)
  alt telefone novo (venceu a disputa pela UNIQUE)
    L->>DB: INSERT lead_events (lead.created)
    L->>D: assign(conn, leadId)
    D->>DB: SELECT vendedor ativo ORDER BY last_assigned_at FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    alt há vendedor ativo
      D->>DB: UPDATE sellers.last_assigned_at
      D->>DB: UPDATE leads SET seller_id, status=assigned WHERE status=unassigned
      D->>DB: INSERT lead_events (lead.assigned, strategy=round_robin)
    else nenhum vendedor ativo
      D-->>L: null (lead permanece unassigned)
    end
    L->>DB: COMMIT
    L-->>API: Lead
    API-->>C: 201 Created + Location
  else ER_DUP_ENTRY em uq_leads_phone (perdeu a disputa)
    L->>DB: ROLLBACK
    L->>DB: SELECT lead existente por phone_e164
    L->>DB: INSERT lead_events (lead.duplicate_attempt)
    L-->>API: DuplicateLeadError
    API-->>C: 409 LEAD_ALREADY_EXISTS (lead_id)
  end
